<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>This macro for the game «Locked» on the Roblox platform performs sequential actions. First, he kicks the ball into the air to the right, turns around to the left, and then activates his swordscrew. Because of swordscrew, instead of going right it will come right back to you. For this macro to work correctly, you will need the SwordScrew weapon in LOCKED. Please note that errors are possible, especially when the ping is high and you're on the wrong sensitivity. It is recommended to set the sensitivity in Roblox to 0.171 and set the DPI to 800, as well as 0.5 sensitivity in LOCKED. The optimal screen resolution is 1920 x 1080, but others can be used, since mouse movements depend on relative coordinates. Carefully adjust the settings to achieve the best results!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
